    "<title>",
    "Patch 61 work.",
    "</title>",
    "<updated>2026-09-23T19:08:30Z</updated>",
    "<media:thumbnail height=\"30\" width=\"30\" url=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/91148465?s=30&amp;v=4\"/>",
    "<author>",
    "<name>gdelaplante</name>",
    "<uri>https://github.com/gdelaplante</uri>",
    "</author>",
    "<content type=\"html\">",
    "&lt;pre style=&#39;white-space:pre-wrap;width:81ex&#39;&gt;Patch 61 work.",
    "- Updated `addACLocation` to improve elevation estimation and datum resolution.",
    "- Enhanced `addNewDiscrete` to use `source_adapter_function` and `external_sample_id`.",
    "- Introduced new functions: `appendImportRunRows`, `completeImportRun`, `createImportRun`, `getImportLocationMappings`, `getImportParameterMappings`, `getImportResultFlagMappings`, `resolveImportLocationMapping`, `resolveImportResultFlagMapping`, `upsertImportLocationMappings`, `upsertImportParameterMappings`, and `upsertImportResultFlagMappings`.",
    "- Removed deprecated `createImportUploadSession` function.",
    "- Updated tests to reflect changes in parameter names and functionality.",
    "- Ensured backward compatibility by maintaining existing functionality while transitioning to new naming conventions.&lt;/pre&gt;",
    "</content>",
    "</entry>",
