    "<title>",
    "Add AquaCache report recipe version 2 schema and validation functions",
    "</title>",
    "<updated>2026-09-07T03:02:55Z</updated>",
    "<media:thumbnail height=\"30\" width=\"30\" url=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/91148465?s=30&amp;v=4\"/>",
    "<author>",
    "<name>gdelaplante</name>",
    "<uri>https://github.com/gdelaplante</uri>",
    "</author>",
    "<content type=\"html\">",
    "&lt;pre style=&#39;white-space:pre-wrap;width:81ex&#39;&gt;Add AquaCache report recipe version 2 schema and validation functions",
    "- Introduced schema-v2.json defining the structure for AquaCache report recipes version 2.",
    "- Implemented validate-json.sql for validating JSON against the defined schema.",
    "- Created validate-v2.sql for structural validation of report recipes, ensuring identity and reference invariants.",
    "- Added an example report recipe (water-quality.example.json) demonstrating the usage of the new schema.&lt;/pre&gt;",
    "</content>",
    "</entry>",
